  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Doctor 8
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: 'Yes! Of course! Well, there is one thing I have to do before I can help.
    Menari is in danger. That tornado tore through this land and most importantly
    right across the great mountain: the home of a viscious, bloodthirsty dragon.
    It isn''t there now, It left last night for its weekly hunt and will return tomorrow
    morning. The problem is, the tornado ripped its eggs frome their nest. If they
    remain scatterd across the land, everyone is in danger.'
  option1:
    text: What do you need to do?
